contrib/grldr and contrib/grub were compiled (from unmodified source) using
GRUB 0.97 (ftp://alpha.gnu.org/gnu/grub/) with grub_for_dos 0.4.2
patchset/build-tree (http://sourceforge.net/projects/grub4dos).

contrib/System.dll cannot be compiled from source (see #319999), so it was
obtained from the NSIS 2.23 binary distribution:
http://nsis.sourceforge.net/Download
